# Task Panel host configuration — generated by `install.sh`.
#
# The host-external supervisor (scripts/supervisor.mjs) reads this file as the
# default for the one policy it owns:
#
#   TASKPANEL_CLAIM_UNASSIGNED=yes  also claim unassigned cards (the public pool)
#   TASKPANEL_CLAIM_UNASSIGNED=no   claim only cards assigned to this agent
#
# A command-line flag (--claim-unassigned) or the environment variable override
# this file; the file is the installer's remembered answer to
# "Allow claiming unassigned tasks?".
TASKPANEL_CLAIM_UNASSIGNED={{CLAIM_UNASSIGNED}}
